      "paperId": "5472609672b3908a57601526d12379aabc06ca76",
      "title": "Still Resisting Left Melancholy? Chinese New Leftist theatre\u2019s inheritance and resistance in Che Guevara (Qie Gewala) (2000\u20131)",
      "authors": [
